  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct Aid Program 2020-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Direct Aid Program (implemented as the Solomon Islands - Australia Community Partnerships from mid-2023) aimed to actively engage rural communities across Solomon Islands in the development process, encouraged small-scale community infrastructure investments and improved health and human development outcomes and living standards. The program funded community-led projects which assisted at a village level, including in the education, health and sanitation sectors.  In addition, resources were used to promote the Solomon Islands - Australia Partnership in development.</narrative>
  </description>
